{"name":"Khaki","hex":"#c3b091","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"khaki","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A dull, yellowish-brown colour, the colour of dust.","Khaki green, a dull green colour."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Dust-coloured; of the colour of dust."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/khaki"}],"entries":[{"title":"Khaki","blocks":[{"text":"The color khaki is a light shade of tan with a slight yellowish tinge."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Marineoffiziere_in_Dakar_%281994%29.jpg/330px-Marineoffiziere_in_Dakar_%281994%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khaki","wikidata":"Q650770"},{"title":"Khaki (2020 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Khaki is a 2020 Indian Kannada-language vigilante action drama film written and directed by Naveen Reddy. B and produced by Tarun Shivappa and Manasa Tarun. It features Chiranjeevi Sarja and Tanya Hope along with Chaya Singh in the lead roles. The supporting cast includes Dev Gill and Shivmani. The score and soundtrack for the film is by Rithvik Muralidhar, the cinematography is by Bala, and the editing by K. M. Prakash. The film was released on 24 January 2020."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/43/Khaki_%282020_film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khaki_(2020_film)","wikidata":"Q86755319"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/A_Tanaoli_of_the_Guides_%28Lumsden%27s%29_Infantry%2C_and_an_Afridi_Daffadar_of_the_Guides_Cavalry%2C_1908_%28c%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-A_Tanaoli_of_the_Guides_%28Lumsden%27s%29_Infantry%2C_and_an_Afridi_Daffadar_of_the_Guides_Cavalry%2C_1908_%28c%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedi